{#- The install-state subtext under an instance's status: the enum's own badge for a state that says
    something, nothing for a quiet one (InstanceModel.isNotableInstallState, the one home of that rule).
    Presentation only: the column's value, its filter and its sort stay the stored state. -#}
{% declare value: EnumBadgeState %}
{% if InstallState.notable(value.key) %}
{% render "zenitcms:cell/enum-badge" var:value=value %}
{% /if %}
